SUMMARY:Rise Up ! - Ecstatic Dance Wave w/ Sara Bensman
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, September 18th\nEvenin
 g Dance Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\
 nFacilitator Sara Bensman\n\nIntention: Rise Up!\n\nIndividuals and commun
 ities throughout the world find themselves on the vulnerable end of a conf
 lict yet find the determination to rise up through civil action\, protest\
 , song\, art\, kindness\, and mutual support. What creates the strength of
  will to move beyond the freeze response in order to create change? This d
 ance honors of the people of the world who transcend the fear and uncertai
 nty and take action toward a more just and kinder planet.\n\n## About Sara
  Bensman\n\nSara’s mix-making arises from musical exploration. She seeks
  to understand energy through somatic responses to sonic vibrations. Her f
 acilitation is propelled by a desire to help build and sustain community b
 y creating a safe\, loving container for self-expression\, connection and 
 release. If you’d like to listen to her sets visit [https://soundcloud.c
 om/sara-bensman](https://soundcloud.com/sara-bensman)\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\
 \* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly 
 at Opening Circle and any that come late will be turned away. Please be on
  time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - 
 $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-regi
 stration Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and d
 ance for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollec
 tive.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fb
 clid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjA
 zOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv
 2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will
  close at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER
  OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillem
 ovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/
 our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYX
 BwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEz
 r2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Mo
 vement Collective envisions a world that moves in harmony where all are fr
